# 📚 StudyMate App

## 📌 Overview
StudyMate is a student productivity app that helps manage tasks, view performance, and track progress using API-based data.

---

## 🚀 Features
- Task management system
- Dashboard with live API data
- Performance tracking (completed, pending, total tasks)
- Pull to refresh data
- Clean UI with Jetpack Compose / React Native (edit as per your app)

---

## 🏗 Architecture
The app follows Clean Architecture:

- UI Layer → Screens (Home, Performance, Profile)
- ViewModel Layer → State management
- Repository Layer → Data handling
- API Layer → Network requests (Retrofit / Axios)

---

## 🌐 API Used
- Base URL: YOUR_API_URL_HERE
- Methods:
  - GET tasks
  - GET performance data

